.SH 標準規格
C11, POSIX.1\-2008.
.SH 歴史
POSIX.1\-2001, C89, SVr4, 4.3BSD.
.SH 警告
The name of this function is confusing; it has no relation to \fBstrncpy\fP(3).
.P
If the destination buffer does not already contain a string, or is not large
enough, the behavior is undefined.  See \fB_FORTIFY_SOURCE\fP in
\fBfeature_test_macros\fP(7).
